WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.617
The eigenvalues of random regular graphs.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.168
Each node has three neighbours, so locally it looks like a tree.

3
00:00:06.318 --> 00:00:09.521
Yet its eigenvalues should repel like a dense random matrix.

4
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.324
Claimed: true for every fixed degree, three or more.

5
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.113
Not machine checked.
